OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader 'hopes' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Awill not leave party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Democratic Unionist
OL,7,FParty (DUP) has said he does not want
OL,8,Fto see Carla Lockhart leave the party.
OL,10,FLockhart has called for the DUP to
OL,11,Fremove First Minister Michelle O'Neill
OL,12,Ffrom office by having Emma
OL,13,FLittle-Pengelly resign from her role as
OL,14,Fdeputy first minister.
OL,16,FHowever on Thursday, the DUP confirmed
OL,17,Fthat Little-Pengelly will not
OL,18,Fparticipate in joint engagements with
OL,19,FO'Neill and permission will not be
OL,20,Fgranted for the first minister to
OL,21,Foperate on a solo basis.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
