OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader 'hopes' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Awill not leave party
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin Robinson said he "hopes" that
OL,7,FLockhart will not leave the party and
OL,8,Fadded: "We all share the same view that
OL,9,Fthere needs to be political sanctions
OL,10,Ffor the behaviour of Michelle O'Neill."
